  "sofas": {
    "title": "Sofas",
    "description": "A sofa is not just the most used piece in a living room. It is where the home slows down.\nFrom morning coffee to family conversations, movie nights, guests, celebrations, and quiet moments alone, the sofa becomes the centre of everyday living. At Maple Furnishers, we design sofa sets that bring comfort, durability, and quiet luxury into your home.\nExplore premium sofa sets for living rooms in different sizes, from compact 2-seater sofas to spacious 8-seater sofa sets. Each piece can be customised in fabric, finish, size, and seating style to match your space and lifestyle.\nOur sofas are crafted in-house using quality materials, strong frames, refined upholstery, and carefully selected finishes. Choose from fabric options such as velvet, leatherette, cotton, polyester, and more, designed to balance comfort, style, and long-term use.\nWhether you want a modern sofa, luxury sofa set, wooden sofa, recliner sofa, or a fully customised design, Maple helps you create a piece that feels personal to your home.\nBring home a sofa that looks beautiful on day one and feels even better with time.",
