  "chairs": {
    "title": "Chairs",
    "description": "Chairs do more than complete a room — they shape the way a space feels. Whether placed around a dining table, beside a coffee corner, or as a statement piece in the living room, the right chair brings together comfort, style, and everyday functionality.\nAt Maple Furnishers, our chair collection is designed to suit the evolving needs of contemporary Indian homes. Each piece is carefully crafted with a focus on ergonomic comfort, refined detailing, and enduring quality using premium woods, fabrics, and finishes.\nFrom sleek modern silhouettes to rich upholstered designs, our range offers versatile options for dining, lounging, working, and entertaining. With customizable fabrics, finishes, and designs, you can create seating that reflects your personal taste and complements your interiors effortlessly.\nBuilt with precision and designed to be lived in every day, Maple chairs combine timeless aesthetics with dependable craftsmanship creating pieces that remain comfortable, elegant, and relevant for years to come.",
